  "name": "Tipo de Afectación del IGV",
  "source": "Anexo 8 RS 097-2012/SUNAT (v2.1), catálogo 07, transcribed from the 'Catálogos' sheet of resources/AjustesValidacionesCPEv20260212.xlsx, which lists código, descripción and código de tributo together. That sheet is what settles code 37 (Inafecto - Transferencia gratuita, tributo 9996): both frontend lists stopped at 36 by omission while Go and the backend already accepted it. SUNAT writes 17 as '1016 o 9996' and 40 as '9995 o 9996' — the second of each applies only to a gratuito line, which is what codes 11-16, 21 and 31-37 already are, so props.taxSchemeCode carries the first. props.percent is the cbc:Percent the line declares, and null means the element is omitted entirely; SUNAT requires the rate tag on every tributo that has one (fault 2992), and gravado-gratuito declares the 18.00 it would have carried. SUNAT's own sheet mixes hyphens and en dashes in the descriptions; normalised to a plain hyphen here.",
  "codePattern": "^[0-9]{2}$",
